      "text": "Dry run on merge operation: \nnums1 = [ 1 , 4 , 5, 8 ]\n \nnums2 = [ 2, 3, 6, 7 ] \n\nlength1 = 4 \nlength2 = 4 \nlength3 = 8 \n\nlist1 = [ 1 , 4 , 5 , 8 ]\n           0  1   2   3\n \nlist2 = [ 2 , 3 , 6 , 7 ] \n           0   1    2  3 \n\nlist3 = [ 1 , 2 , 3 , 4 , 5 , 6 , 7 , 8 ]\n           0   1   2  3   4   5   6  7",
